  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "subtitle2",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 138,
   "width": 1300,
   "height": 20,
   "text": "An order can be CONFIRMED while its ticket is still NEW; a payment can be refunded long after the order is COMPLETED.",
